Inside Write, Match? compares Expected rev from Edit with Stored rev read inside the serialized operation.
Yes permits Commit, then Saved reports the new revision.
No produces No write: no temporary file, rename, or revision increment.
Another write cannot enter between this comparison and Commit.
The overview's recovery loop must read current content and reapply the intended change, not merely replace the revision number.

